{"name":"Anakiwa","hex":"#8cceea","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Anakiwa","blocks":[{"text":"Anakiwa is a coastal residential village in the Marlborough region of New Zealand. It sits at the head of Queen Charlotte Sound/Tōtaranui, one of the Marlborough Sounds, 23 km (14 mi) west of Picton and 18 km (11 mi) east of Havelock. At the 2018 census, the village had a usual resident population of 171."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Anakiwa%2C_New_Zealand.jpg/330px-Anakiwa%2C_New_Zealand.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anakiwa","wikidata":"Q4750973"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Hinckley 42 Daysailor by Don Ramey Logan","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Hinckley_42_Daysailor_by_Don_Ramey_Logan.jpg/500px-Hinckley_42_Daysailor_by_Don_Ramey_Logan.jpg","ratio":0.9758597883597884,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hinckley_42_Daysailor_by_Don_Ramey_Logan.jpg","share":0.158125},{"title":"Basilica Sancti Petri blue hour","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Basilica_Sancti_Petri_blue_hour.jpg/500px-Basilica_Sancti_Petri_blue_hour.jpg","ratio":1.4041368337311058,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Basilica_Sancti_Petri_blue_hour.jpg","share":0.118125},{"title":"Law Courts during blue hour, Christchurch, New Zealand","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Law_Courts_during_blue_hour%2C_Christchurch%2C_New_Zealand.jpg/500px-Law_Courts_during_blue_hour%2C_Christchurch%2C_New_Zealand.jpg","ratio":1.5641237113402062,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Law_Courts_during_blue_hour,_Christchurch,_New_Zealand.jpg","share":0.11125},{"title":"The blue of the sky","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/The_blue_of_the_sky.jpg/500px-The_blue_of_the_sky.jpg","ratio":1.5,"li